{"id":"wb-1-145","name":"曲阜鲁国故城","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"曲阜鲁国故城","text":"曲阜鲁国故城，是中国周朝时期鲁国的都城，是周王朝各诸侯国中延续时间最长的都城，现存鲁国故城面积约10.45平方公里。1961年，曲阜鲁国故城被列为第一批全国重点文物保护单位。鲁国故城的中心是鲁国的祖庙，即曲阜周公庙。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9B%B2%E9%98%9C%E9%B2%81%E5%9B%BD%E6%95%85%E5%9F%8E","revisionId":86785683,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86785683","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/56c18b03b04c62c64ed646e5.jpg","title":"Qufu_Luguo_Gucheng_2015.08.16_08-43-28.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Qufu_Luguo_Gucheng_2015.08.16_08-43-28.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/92/Qufu_Luguo_Gucheng_2015.08.16_08-43-28.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"周公庙东北侧的鲁国故城国家考古遗址公园，此处原为鲁国宫殿所在地","width":320,"height":213}}